                    <msContents>
                      <summary/>
                      
                      <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                        <locus from="1r" to="72v"/>
                        <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1693John">Gospel of John (Collection)</title>
                        <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                        
                        <note>The text is divided into lessons for each day of the week, but some titles have been  washed out. 
                          Those left are on: <locus target="#8v"/> on Sunday, <locus target="#10r"/> on Monday, <locus target="#57r"/> on Saturday, <locus target="#59r"/> on Friday, <locus target="#66v"/> on Sunday.
                          The titles on <locus target="#18v #32v #36r #46v"/> have disappeared.</note>
                    
                        <note>The text is  divided carelessly into sections (<q xml:lang="gez">ምእራፍ፡</q>). The sections numbered 1–10 are at 2, 1. 13; 3, 1. 22; 4, 5. 45; 5, 1; 6, 1. 16; 7, 1. The sections without numbers are at 9, 1; 10, 1. 22; 11, 1. The sections numbered 13–16
                        are at 12, 1. 12. 20; 13, 1. The section numbered 21 is at 15, 26.</note>
                      
                      </msItem>
                      
                    </msContents>
                  
